-- title:
--   Embedding by sections of a power of coprime degree
-- statement:
--   For $L$ ample on $S$ and $a>0$ there are $b>0$ coprime to $a$ and sections of $L^b$ indexed by $\operatorname{Option}(\operatorname{Fin}N)$ with iso-opens covering $S$ defining a closed immersion.
--
--   **Notation.** The iso-open of $s$ (`SectionOpens.isoOpen s`) is the union of the opens on which the morphism $s$ restricts to an isomorphism. `sectionsMorphism k s hs` is the morphism from $X$ to $\operatorname{Proj}$ of the graded polynomial ring in variables indexed by the sections, defined by sections whose iso-opens cover $X$, with $k$ the ring map from the base into $\Gamma(X,\top)$. `IsAmple` means that for each point $x$ and open $V\ni x$, some positive power has a global section with nonvanishing open containing $x$, inside $V$, and affine. A `Surface` is an integral scheme smooth of relative dimension 2 over $\operatorname{Spec}\mathbb C$ with a closed immersion into some complex projective space over $\mathbb C$.
--
--   **Formalization Note** The statement is verbatim from OpenAI's Lean development, with `Definitions` files of this development imported in place of the upstream modules; these are supporting code for the statement.
-- source:
--   OpenAI, Maximal Seshadri constants on arbitrary polarized surfaces, September 23, 2026, https://github.com/openai/math (paper: preprints/Maximal-Seshadri-Constants-on-Arbitrary-Polarized-Surfaces-September-23-2026/main.pdf; Lean: lean/OAI/AlgebraicGeometry/Seshadri, Apache License 2.0); Lean declaration `OAI.MaximalSeshadri.Geometry.Surface.coprime_embedding_option`, https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/lean/OAI/AlgebraicGeometry/Seshadri/Projective/CoprimeEmbedding.lean#L46

import Mathlib
import Definitions.Def_MaximalSeshadriConstants
import Definitions.Def_SeshadriPrelim6

namespace OAI

section

namespace MaximalSeshadri.Geometry
noncomputable section
open AlgebraicGeometry CategoryTheory CategoryTheory.Limits TopologicalSpace Opposite
open MaximalSeshadri.Frames MaximalSeshadri.TensorPure MaximalSeshadri.Projective

variable {X : Scheme.{0}} {K : Type} [CommRing K]

theorem Surface.coprime_embedding_option (S : Surface) (L : LineBundle S.scheme)
    (hL : L.IsAmple) (a : ℕ) (ha : 0 < a) :
    ∃ b : ℕ, 0 < b ∧ Nat.Coprime a b ∧ ∃ N : ℕ,
      ∃ s : Option (Fin N) → GlobalSections S.scheme (L.pow b).sheaf,
      ∃ hs : (⨆ i, SectionOpens.isoOpen (s i)) = ⊤,
        IsClosedImmersion (sectionsMorphism
          (S.structureMap.appTop.hom.comp (Scheme.ΓSpecIso (CommRingCat.of ℂ)).inv.hom) s hs) := by
  sorry

end
end MaximalSeshadri.Geometry
end
end OAI
